        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="finding" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8EC;strokeColor=#B58A4B;fontColor=#17333A;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=8;" value="W06-S03 policy: STREETLIGHT → Electrical; DRAIN → Drainage; BRIDGE → Structures.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;W06-S04 log: all eight accepted. CJ-803, CJ-804, CJ-807 are BRIDGE reports recorded as received by Electrical. The other five deliveries match policy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Finding: three recorded BRIDGE deliveries conflict with the approved destination policy. The evidence establishes the discrepancy, not its cause.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Next evidence: running D2 Routing Table configuration and change/deployment history. No runtime snapshot or code was supplied." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="430" width="500" x="550" y="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
